---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import f from '../content/festival.json';
import events from '../content/events.json';
---
<Base><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">MEDICINE. DISCOVERY. POSSIBILITY.</p><h1>A meeting<br/>of <em>brilliant</em><br/>minds.</h1><p class="intro">{f.tagline}</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/events/">Explore events <span>↗</span></a><a href="/schedule/">Discover the experience →</a></div><p class="date">{f.displayName} &nbsp; / &nbsp; {f.date} · Provisional</p></div><figure class="hero-art"><img src="/art/13.webp" alt="Renaissance-style illustration of practitioners gathered around a surgical demonstration" width="800" height="962"/><figcaption>THE ART OF LEARNING. THE SCIENCE OF TOMORROW.</figcaption><span class="seal" aria-hidden="true">P<br/>✧</span></figure></section><div class="ribbon">CURIOSITY MEETS CLINICAL PRACTICE <span>✦</span> KNOWLEDGE BECOMES POSSIBILITY <span>✦</span> THE NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</div><section id="about" class="story"><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE PLEXUS PHILOSOPHY</p><h2>Great medicine begins<br/>with <em>connection.</em></h2><div><p class="intro">Between ideas and action.<br/>Between the classroom and the clinic.<br/>Between the minds shaping what comes next.</p><p>A space to explore clinical skills, exchange perspectives and celebrate the pursuit of knowledge. Discover a programme inspired by the art and science of medicine.</p></div></section><section class="tracks"><div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / CHOOSE YOUR PURSUIT</p><h2>Two worlds.<br/><em>One curious mind.</em></h2></div><p>Learn by doing. Discover by questioning.<br/>Find your place in the experience.</p></div><div class="track-grid"><a class="track green" href="/events/?track=workshop"><img src="/art/20.webp" alt="" width="800" height="1000" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">THE WORKSHOP SERIES / PRAYOGAH</p><h3>The art of<br/><em>clinical practice.</em></h3><p>Hands-on learning. Skills that matter.</p><span>Explore workshops ↗</span></div></a><a class="track clay" href="/events/?track=academic"><img src="/art/22.webp" alt="" width="800" height="1000" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">THE ACADEMIC ARENA / ANVESHANAM</p><h3>The pursuit<br/><em>of knowledge.</em></h3><p>Research, ideas and academic challenges.</p><span>Explore academic events ↗</span></div></a></div></section><section><div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / A TASTE OF THE EXPERIENCE</p><h2>Follow your <em>curiosity.</em></h2></div><a href="/events/">View all events ↗</a></div><div class="cards">{events.slice(0,3).map(e=><a class="card" href={'/events/'+e.slug+'/'}><img src={'/art/'+e.art+'.webp'} width="800" height="962" loading="lazy" alt=""/><p class="eyebrow">WORKSHOP · PROVISIONAL</p><h3>{e.title}</h3><p>{e.subtitle}</p><span>View event ↗</span></a>)}</div></section><section class="invitation"><p class="eyebrow">A NEW CHAPTER IS TAKING SHAPE</p><h2>Make room for<br/><em>something remarkable.</em></h2><p>Programme timings and registration details are coming soon.</p><a class="button" href="/schedule/">Preview the schedule ↗</a></section><section class="faq"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p><h2>Before you <em>join us.</em></h2><details><summary>When is the festival?</summary><p>{f.date} is the working date. Final dates and duration will be announced here.</p></details><details><summary>How do I register?</summary><p>Registration details are coming soon. Approved Google Forms will appear on individual event pages.</p></details><details><summary>Who can participate, and what does it cost?</summary><p>Eligibility and fees will be published with the confirmed programme. Unknown fees do not mean free entry.</p></details><a href="/visit/">Venue & visitor information ↗</a></section></Base>